  "_ranks_doc": "Junior first — ORDER IS SENIORITY, and the engine reads nothing else. Third Lieutenant is Heinlein's own invention: a cadet officer on trial, who outranks every sergeant on paper and is expected to listen to all of them. It sits above Fleet Sergeant because command authority is what the ladder measures.",
